          neutralized by the addition of 15.33mL of 6.00M HCl?
        </p>
      </introduction>

      <exercise>
        <statement>
          <p>
            What was the starting pH of that NaOH solution?
          </p>
        </statement>

        <answer>
          <p>
            What was the starting pH of that NaOH solution?
          </p>
        </answer>
      </exercise>
    </exercisegroup>

    <exercise>
